  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Simplify File Management with the FTP Connector for Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "File Transfer Protocol (FTP) is an application layer internet standard protocol that is used to transfer files between computers over a network. You can use the FTP Connector to orchestrate various types of file operations on an FTP server as part of Camunda-based processes.",
